    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha mutwe gw'akasozi akali kwonka, nuho haimukire ebendera ey'obulemi! Mwamirre abaserikale, mubaimukize emikono nimubasimiza baseesire amalembo g'orubuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyowe nyenka, ninyowe ndagiire abange abansoroire, ninyowe nyesire emanzi zange kuumara akaniga, bafubire abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhurre obwogo obunyakuli ha nsozi, nk'oburukuteerwa abantu abaingi! Muhurre okwimukiirwa kw'amahanga agarukwesorooza hamu! MUKAMA ow'amahe naazinisa ihe ery'okurwana obulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahe ago nigaruga omunsi eya hara, nigaruga haiguru nambere ligarukira, MUKAMA anyakwina ekiniga naija kuhwerekereza ensi yoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
